      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The famed \"Empire Builder\" railroad route was routed through Sault Ste. Marie, linking the Midwest to the Great Lakes.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sault_Ste._Marie%2C_Ontario",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Boat tours of the Sault locks, part of the Marie Canal National Historic Site, connect Lake Superior to the lower Great Lakes.",
